  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/D95R\r\n\r\nEnjoy the perfect combination of modern comfort, generous space and coastal convenience in this beautifully designed brand-new home. Featuring light-filled interiors, a timeless neutral colour palette and a thoughtfully planned layout, this stylish residence offers 5 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, 2 living areas and a dedicated office, providing exceptional flexibility for modern family living on a freehold section.\r\n\r\nStep inside and be welcomed by a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where natural light creates a warm and inviting atmosphere. The contemporary kitchen is beautifully appointed for everyday living and entertaining, while seamless indoor-outdoor flow leads to a sunny deck, perfect for family gatherings, summer BBQs or simply relaxing outdoors.\r\n\r\nAdding to the home's versatility is a ground-floor bedroom complete with its own ensuite and separate entrance, making it an ideal retreat for extended family, guests or a flatmate. A convenient guest toilet completes this level.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a welcoming family lounge provides a second living space, perfect for relaxing or spending quality time together. Two generously sized bedrooms feature their own ensuites, including the impressive master suite with a walk-in wardrobe, a beautifully appointed ensuite with a bathtub, and a private balcony where you can unwind and enjoy lovely sea views. Two additional bedrooms are serviced by a modern bathroom, while a dedicated office offers a quiet and practical space for working or studying from home.\r\n\r\nPositioned as an end unit, the property enjoys the added advantage of extra off-street parking alongside the internal-access double garage, providing excellent convenience for families with multiple vehicles or visiting guests.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing. Within walking distance of Browns Bay School and zoned for Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Rangitoto College, this address is an excellent choice for families. A short stroll takes you to beautiful Rothesay Bay Beach, Browns Bay Beach and the vibrant village, where supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, shops and a wide range of everyday amenities are all within easy reach. With a bus stop just up the road, getting around is convenient too.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beautifully presented and superbly located, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy spacious, low-maintenance coastal living in one of the North Shore's most popular neighbourhoods. Make it yours today!\r\n\r\nExplore another home in this development by following the link below:\r\nhttps://www.cooperandco.co.nz/listing/l43002179-2d-hyde-road-rothesay-bay-nz-0630\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
